+# URL structure — Shukla Travels
+
+Preferred host: `https://www.shuklatravelsjbp.com` (trailing slashes).
+
+- `/` homepage
+- `/taxi-services/` and `/taxi-services/{slug}/`
+- `/tours/` `/tours/{category}/` `/tours/{category}/{slug}/`
+- `/destinations/` `/destinations/{slug}/`
+- `/national-parks/` `/national-parks/{slug}/`
+- `/routes/` `/routes/jabalpur-to-{place}/`
+- `/vehicles/` `/vehicles/{slug}/`
+- `/corporate/` `/about-us/` `/contact-us/` `/faq/` `/blog/` `/blog/{slug}/`
+- `/plan-your-trip/` `/build-your-tour/` `/thank-you/` (noindex)
+- `/search/` (noindex)
+- `/admin/` (noindex)
+- Legal: `/privacy-policy/` `/terms-and-conditions/` `/cancellation-refund-policy/` `/disclaimer/` `/cookie-policy/`
