y longer than Kanha for typical lodges. We quote after you share the hotel.",time:"Plan a full transfer window; do not stack a safari the same morning.",road:"State highways via Seoni belt depending on side.",vehicle:"SUV / Innova.",stops:["Seoni / highway meals"],itinerary:"Full day transfer, safari next morning.",faqs:[{q:"Better to fly Nagpur?",a:"Sometimes. We can still do Jabalpur if that is your hub."}]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-pachmarhi",from:"Jabalpur",to:"Pachmarhi",toSlug:"pachmarhi",overview:"Hill-station outstation favourite. Last stretch is ghat road.",distance:"Typically in the 200 km region depending on route. Confirm.",time:"Often 5–6+ hours including ghats. Monsoon slower.",road:"Highway then hill road. Experienced driver recommended.",vehicle:"SUV comfortable on ghats; Tempo Traveller for groups.",stops:["Pipariya belt"],itinerary:"Morning start, afternoon hotel, evening local walk.",faqs:[{q:"Safe in monsoon?",a:"We assess weather. Some days it is wiser to delay."}]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-amarkantak",from:"Jabalpur",to:"Amarkantak",toSlug:"amarkantak",overview:"Pilgrimage and plateau drive east of Jabalpur.",distance:"Typically around 200+ km by common roads. Confirm routing.",time:"Often 5–6 hours class, variable.",road:"Highway and forested plateau approaches.",vehicle:"Sedan or SUV.",stops:["Tea at highway towns"],itinerary:"Morning departure, evening temples.",faqs:[{q:"Same day return?",a:"Possible but tiring. Overnight is kinder."}]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-khajuraho",from:"Jabalpur",to:"Khajuraho",toSlug:"khajuraho",overview:"Heritage highway day. Not a short hop.",distance:"Long outstation—typically 300 km class depending on route. Confirm.",time:"Plan most of a day on the road.",road:"National/state highways via Satna belt often.",vehicle:"SUV / Innova for comfort.",stops:["Satna / meal"],itinerary:"Early start, evening Khajuraho, temples next day.",faqs:[{q:"Break at Maihar?",a:"Yes, if you want Sharda darshan."}]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-panna",from:"Jabalpur",to:"Panna",toSlug:"panna",overview:"Usually the Khajuraho–Panna belt rather than a separate isolated drop.",distance:"Similar long-haul to Khajuraho, then local to the gate.",time:"Full day transfer.",road:"Via Khajuraho region typically.",vehicle:"SUV.",stops:["Khajuraho"],itinerary:"Reach lodge, safari next day.",faqs:[{q:"Stay Khajuraho or Panna?",a:"Depends on safari gate."}]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-satpura",from:"Jabalpur",to:"Satpura",toSlug:"satpura",overview:"Toward Madhai / Pachmarhi–Satpura entries.",distance:"Depends on the exact park entry. Quoted after lodge name.",time:"Half to most of a day.",road:"Highway plus interior.",vehicle:"SUV.",stops:["Pipariya"],itinerary:"Transfer day, activity next day.",faqs:[{q:"Combine Pachmarhi?",a:"Yes."}]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-ujjain",from:"Jabalpur",to:"Ujjain",toSlug:"ujjain",overview:"Long pilgrimage outstation across the state.",distance:"Long-distance (typically 500 km class). Confirm route via Bhopal or other.",time:"Full long day. Overnight halt can be wiser.",road:"National highways.",vehicle:"Innova / SUV for families.",stops:["Bhopal optional halt"],itinerary:"Start very early or split days.",faqs:[{q:"Train better?",a:"Sometimes. We still do station taxis at both ends."}]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-omkareshwar",from:"Jabalpur",to:"Omkareshwar",toSlug:"omkareshwar",overview:"Long Narmada-west pilgrimage drive.",distance:"Long-distance; confirm. Not a day-trip comfortably.",time:"Long full day.",road:"Highways via central MP.",vehicle:"SUV / Innova.",stops:["Indore belt optional"],itinerary:"Split with Ujjain or Indore if possible.",faqs:[{q:"Add Maheshwar?",a:"Yes, short hop from Omkareshwar relative to Jabalpur."}]}],u=[{slug:"best-places-to-visit-in-jabalpur",title:"Best Places to Visit in Jabalpur",category:"Jabalpur Travel",date:"2026-01-15",excerpt:"A practical shortlist: Bhedaghat, Dhuandhar, city forts and how to move between them by taxi.",body:["Jabalpur rewards a one- or two-day halt. The signature outing is Bhedaghat: marble cliffs on the Narmada and the spray of Dhuandhar. Boat rides are seasonal and authority-run—treat them as a bonus, not a guarantee.","In the city, Madan Mahal Fort and the Balancing Rock are short visits. The Rani Durgavati Museum suits a quieter hour. Pair these with a chauffeur so you are not stitching auto routes in the heat.","Shukla Travels can run a sightseeing taxi from your hotel, the airport or the junction. If you have a same-day train, say so—we will cut the circuit rather than miss the departure."]},{slug:"best-places-to-visit-near-jabalpur",title:"Best Places to Visit Near Jabalpur",category:"Jabalpur Travel",date:"2026-01-16",excerpt:"Kanha, Bandhavgarh, Pachmarhi, Amarkantak and Maihar as realistic outstation ideas.",body:["Near is relative. Bhedaghat is local. Maihar can be a long day. Kanha and Bandhavgarh are overnight wildlife trips. Pachmarhi and Amarkantak are hill/plateau overnights.","Choose by interest, not by a copied ‘50 places’ list. Wildlife needs park open season. Pilgrimage needs temple energy. Hills need ghat comfort."]},{slug:"jabalpur-travel-guide",title:"Jabalpur Travel Guide",category:"Jabalpur Travel",date:"2026-01-18",excerpt:"How to use Jabalpur as a gateway: airport, station, Bhedaghat and onward parks.",body:["Fly into Dumna (JLR) or arrive at Jabalpur Junction. Keep buffer before wildlife transfers—safari mornings start early at the park, not in the city.","Eat local, but keep the next day’s drive in mind. We can hold luggage in the car between station and Bhedaghat if your rooms are not ready."]},{slug:"jabalpur-taxi-booking-guide",title:"Jabalpur Taxi Booking Guide",category:"Taxi Guides",date:"2026-01-20",excerpt:"What to send so a Jabalpur cab quote is accurate the first time.",body:["Share pickup pin, drop pin, date, time, passenger count, bags, and whether you need a return. For airport, add flight number. For parks, add lodge name.","Beware of unnamed ‘cheapest taxi’ lists. A written quote with vehicle class and inclusions is safer than a verbal km rate with silent extras."]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-kanha-travel-guide",title:"Jabalpur to Kanha Travel Guide",category:"Road Trips",date:"2026-02-01",excerpt:"Gates, timing and why the lodge name matters more than a round number of kilometres.",body:["Kanha has multiple tourism gates. A car that goes to the wrong belt wastes hours. Send the hotel name first.","Start in the morning from Jabalpur. Keep the evening free. Safari permits are a separate official process."]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-bandhavgarh-travel-guide",title:"Jabalpur to Bandhavgarh Travel Guide",category:"Road Trips",date:"2026-02-02",excerpt:"Umaria vs Jabalpur starts, Tala and other gates.",body:["Some guests take a train toward Umaria and a short cab. Others want a single Jabalpur car. Both work; the quote differs.","Do not copy old safari prices from blogs."]},{slug:"jabalpur-to-pench-travel-guide",title:"Jabalpur to Pench Travel Guide",category:"Road Trips",date:"2026-02-03",excerpt:"Why Pench from Jabalpur is a longer planning problem than Kanha.",body:["Confirm the state side of your lodge. MP and Maharashtra permits are different worlds.","Nagpur may be a better air gateway. Jabalpur still works if that is where you already are."]},{slug:"best-time-to-visit-kanha",title:"Best Time to Visit Kanha",category:"Wildlife",date:"2026-02-10",excerpt:"Seasonality without fake guarantees.",body:["Cooler months are popular. Summer is hotter with different animal movement patterns. Monsoon usually means park closure of core tourism—verify the year’s official notice.","‘Best’ for photography is not always ‘best’ for family comfort. Tell us which you care about."]},{slug:"best-time-to-visit-bandhavgarh",title:"Best Time to Visit Bandhavgarh",category:"Wildlife",date:"2026-02-11",excerpt:"Open season versus crowd and heat.",body:["Same central-Indian pattern as Kanha. Confirm the forest calendar, not a screenshot from three years ago."]},{slug:"best-time-to-visit-pench",title:"Best Time to Visit Pench",category:"Wildlife",date:"2026-02-12",excerpt:"Pench season notes.",body:["Follow the official open season for the side you will enter. Winter is the comfort default for most families."]},{slug:"madhya-pradesh-national-parks-guide",title:"Madhya Pradesh National Parks Guide",category:"National Parks",date:"2026-02-20",excerpt:"Kanha, Bandhavgarh, Pench, Satpura, Panna, Kuno and others—how to choose.",body:["If you start in Jabalpur and want a first tiger-reserve trip, Kanha or Bandhavgarh are the usual answers. Pench is easier from Nagpur. Panna pairs with Khajuraho. Satpura pairs with Pachmarhi. Kuno is a special-case, rules-first destination.","Van Vihar in Bhopal is an urban park, not a jungle-lodge holiday."]},{slug:"best-wildlife-destinations-in-madhya-pradesh",title:"Best Wildlife Destinations in Madhya Pradesh",category:"Wildlife",date:"2026-02-21",excerpt:"Match the park to the traveller, not to a ranking table.",body:["There is no honest universal ranking. Accessibility, nights available, and whether you also want temples or hills should decide."]},{slug:"best-weekend-trips-from-jabalpur",title:"Best Weekend Trips from Jabalpur",category:"Family Travel",date:"2026-03-01",excerpt:"Bhedaghat plus one overnight idea.",body:["Friday night or Saturday dawn starts make Pachmarhi, Amarkantak or a single Kanha night possible. Two park nights need more leave."]},{slug:"best-family-destinations-in-madhya-pradesh",title:"Best Family Destinations in Madhya Pradesh",category:"Family Travel",date:"2026-03-02",excerpt:"Pachmarhi, Bhedaghat, gentle wildlife, Khajuraho with shade breaks.",body:["Skip stacked pre-dawn safaris with toddlers. Hills and marble rocks are easier first trips."]},{slug:"madhya-pradesh-road-trip-guide",title:"Madhya Pradesh Road Trip Guide",category:"Road Trips",date:"2026-03-10",excerpt:"How we think about MP road days.",body:["One long highway day then a short local day beats two punishing transfers. Wildlife, pilgrimage and heritage each have different start times."]},{slug:"mp-pilgrimage-circuit",title:"MP Pilgrimage Circuit",category:"Pilgrimage",date:"2026-03-12",excerpt:"Ujjain, Omkareshwar, Maheshwar, Amarkantak, Maihar, Chitrakoot.",body:["Do not force all of them in five days. West MP and east MP are different road stories from Jabalpur."]},{slug:"mp-heritage-circuit",title:"MP Heritage Circuit",category:"Heritage",date:"2026-03-13",excerpt:"Khajuraho, Orchha, Gwalior, Sanchi, Mandu, Bhimbetka.",body:["Use Bhopal or Khajuraho as sub-hubs. Jabalpur can start the story but should not be the only night if you go north and west."]},{slug:"how-to-plan-a-madhya-pradesh-tour",title:"How to Plan a Madhya Pradesh Tour",category:"Itineraries",date:"2026-03-20",excerpt:"A simple planning order that actually works.",body:["1) Season. 2) Interest (wildlife / pilgrimage / heritage / hills). 3) Arrival city. 4) Nights. 5) Vehicle. 6) Permits. 7) Quote.","Shukla Travels can run steps 5–7 with you. Steps 1–4 need your honesty about pace."]},{slug:"how-to-plan-a-wildlife-trip",title:"How to Plan a Wildlife Trip",category:"Wildlife",date:"2026-03-21",excerpt:"Permits, gates, buffers and cars.",body:["Book the lodge near the gate you hope to safari. Apply permits on official portals. Keep a buffer night. Hire a car that can do forest approach roads without drama."]}],p=[{q:"How can I book a taxi in Jabalpur?",a:"Call +91 9329672540, WhatsApp the same number, or send the quote form with pickup, drop and date."},{q:"What taxi services are available in Jabalpur?",a:"Local, outstation, airport, railway, sightseeing, one-way, round-trip, chauffeur-driven rental, Tempo Traveller (subject to availability) and MP tour cars."},{q:"Can I book an outstation taxi from Jabalpur?",a:"Yes. Share destination and dates for a written quote."},{q:"Can I book a one-way taxi?",a:"Yes. One-way and round-trip are quoted differently."},{q:"Can I book a round-trip taxi?",a:"Yes, including multi-day with night halt as agreed."},{q:"Can I hire a car with driver?",a:"Yes. Shukla Travels focuses on chauffeur-driven cars."},{q:"Can I book Jabalpur airport taxi?",a:"Yes, for Dumna Airport (JLR) pickup and drop."},{q:"Can I book Jabalpur railway station taxi?",a:"Yes, including Jabalpur Junction."},{q:"Can I plan a customized MP tour?",a:"Yes. Use Plan Your MP Trip, Build Your Own Tour, or message your list of places."},{q:"Can I book a Kanha tour from Jabalpur?",a:"Yes. Transport is arranged by us; safari permits follow forest department rules."},{q:"Can I book a Bandhavgarh tour from Jabalpur?",a:"Yes, on the same pattern as Kanha."},{q:"Which national parks can I visit from Jabalpur?",a:"Kanha and Bandhavgarh are the most practical. Pench, Satpura and Panna are possible with longer or different routing."},{q:"Can I arrange a family tour?",a:"Yes. Tell us ages and pace."},{q:"Can I arrange a wildlife tour?",a:"Yes. We plan vehicles and days; we do not guarantee sightings or permits."},{q:"Can I book corporate transportation?",a:"Yes. Share company contact, GST needs and movement pattern."},{q:"Do you publish taxi fares?",a:"No public fare table. Quotes depend on route, vehicle, dates and inclusions."},{q:"Do you take online payment on this website?",a:"This site collects enquiries. Payment method is confirmed when your quote is accepted."}];function c(){let[a,e]=(0,o.useState)(""),t=a.toLowerCase().trim(),c=a=>!t||a.toLowerCase().includes(t),g=(0,o.useMemo)(()=>[{title:"Tours",items:l.gB.filter(a=>c(a.name+a.short)).map(a=>({href:"/tours/".concat(a.category,"/").concat(a.slug,"/"),label:a.name}))},{title:"Destinations",items:n.M.filter(a=>c(a.name+a.short)).map(a=>({href:"/destinations/".concat(a.slug,"/"),label:a.name}))},{title:"National Parks",items:s.F.filter(a=>c(a.name)).map(a=>({href:"/national-parks/".concat(a.slug,"/"),label:a.name}))},{title:"Taxi",items:h.l.filter(a=>c(a.name)).map(a=>({href:"/taxi-services/".concat(a.slug,"/"),label:a.name}))},{title:"Route