 common approach. Umaria has a railway station used by some travellers.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Jabalpur connection</h2><p class="mt-2">Shukla Travels runs Jabalpur–Bandhavgarh taxi and tour enquiries, including combinations with Kanha or Khajuraho when requested.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Suggested itinerary</h2><p class="mt-2"><strong>Day 1<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Drive from Jabalpur. Settle at stay near chosen gate.</p><p class="mt-2"><strong>Day 2<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Safari as per confirmed permit.</p><p class="mt-2"><strong>Day 3<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Return or continue to Kanha / Khajuraho.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Taxi options</h2><p class="mt-2">Request a Jabalpur taxi, outstation car or sightseeing cab for <!-- -->Bandhavgarh<!-- -->.</p><a class="text-[var(--moss)] underline" href="/taxi-services/jabalpur-taxi-service/">Jabalpur taxi service</a></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Tour packages</h2><ul class="mt-2"><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/wildlife-tours/jabalpur-bandhavgarh-tour/">Jabalpur Bandhavgarh Tour</a></li><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/wildlife-tours/mp-wildlife-tour/">MP Wildlife Tour</a></li><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/wildlife-tours/bandhavgarh-wildlife-tour/">Bandhavgarh Wildlife Tour</a></li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Routes from Jabalpur</h2><p><a class="underline" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-bandhavgarh/">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Bandhavgarh</a></p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Nearby destinations</h2><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="rounded-full bg-[var(--sand)] px-3 py-1 text-sm" href="/destinations/jabalpur/">Jabalpur</a><a class="rounded-full bg-[var(--sand)] px-3 py-1 text-sm" href="/destinati