)]">Best time to visit</h2><p class="mt-2">Core safari seasons are generally winter to early summer; the park typically closes in monsoon. Verify current open dates with the Madhya Pradesh forest booking system.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">How to reach</h2><p class="mt-2">Kanha is commonly reached by road from Jabalpur. The nearest major rail/air hub for many guests is Jabalpur.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Jabalpur connection</h2><p class="mt-2">Jabalpur is a frequent start point for Kanha transfers and Kanha tour packages arranged by Shukla Travels.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Suggested itinerary</h2><p class="mt-2"><strong>Day 1<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Jabalpur to Kanha by taxi. Evening at lodge.</p><p class="mt-2"><strong>Day 2<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Morning safari if permit is confirmed. Afternoon rest or second safari.</p><p class="mt-2"><strong>Day 3<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Optional safari and return to Jabalpur.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Taxi options</h2><p class="mt-2">Request a Jabalpur taxi, outstation car or sightseeing cab for <!-- -->Kanha<!-- -->.</p><a class="text-[var(--moss)] underline" href="/taxi-services/jabalpur-taxi-service/">Jabalpur taxi service</a></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Tour packages</h2><ul class="mt-2"><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/wildlife-tours/jabalpur-kanha-tour/">Jabalpur Kanha Tour</a></li><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/wildlife-tours/mp-wildlife-tour/">MP Wildlife Tour</a></li><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/family-tours/mp-family-tour/">MP Family Tour</a></li><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/customized-tours/mp-customized-tour/">MP Customized Tour</a></li><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/wildlife-tours/kanha-wildlife-tour/">Kanha Wildlife Tour</a></l