tpura hill station with waterfalls, caves and colonial-era viewpoints.</p></div></div><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="container-st py-4 text-sm text-stone-600"><ol class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><a class="hover:underline" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><span>/</span><a class="hover:underline" href="/destinations/">Destinations</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><span>/</span><span class="text-stone-800">Pachmarhi</span></li></ol></nav><article class="container-st grid gap-10 pb-16 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="prose-st lg:col-span-2 space-y-8"><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Overview</h2><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Pachmarhi is Madhya Pradesh’s best-known hill retreat, inside the Satpura landscape. It suits families, couples and monsoon/waterfall trips when roads are safe.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Why visit</h2><ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5"><li>Cooler hill climate versus the plains</li><li>Waterfalls and view points</li><li>Combine with Satpura National Park if planned carefully</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Top attractions</h2><ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5"><li>Bee Falls</li><li>Dhupgarh</li><li>Jata Shankar</li><li>Pandav Caves</li><li>Handi Khoh</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Things to do</h2><ul class="mt-2 list-disc pl-5"><li>Local sightseeing by cab</li><li>Short treks on marked paths</li><li>Photography</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Best time to visit</h2><p class="mt-2">October–March for pleasant weather; monsoon for waterfalls if you accept rain and possible road delays.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">How to reach</h2><p class="mt-2">Road from Pipariya (rail) or from Jabalpur/Bhopal by taxi. Hill roads need an experienced driver.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Jabalpur connection</h2><p class="mt-2">Jabalpur to Pachmarhi is a popular outstation taxi route with Shukla Travels.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Suggested itinerary</h2><p class="mt-2"><strong>Day 1<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Arrive, local market and a nearby fall if time.</p><p class="mt-2"><strong>Day 2<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Dhupgarh sunrise (seasonal) and major caves/falls circuit.</p><p class="mt-2"><strong>Day 3<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Remaining spots and return.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Taxi options</h2><p class="mt-2">Request a Jabalpur taxi, outstation car or sightseeing cab for <!-- -->Pachmarhi<!-- -->.</p><a class="text-[var(--moss)] underline" href="/taxi-services/jabalpur-taxi-service/">Jabalpur taxi service</a></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Tour packages</h2><ul class="mt-2"><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/weekend-tours/jabalpur-pachmarhi-tour/">Jabalpur Pachmarhi Tour</a></li><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/nature-tours/jabalpur-satpura-tour/">Jabalpur Satpura Tour</a></li><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/family-tours/mp-family-tour/">MP Family Tour</a></li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Routes from Jabalpur</h2><p><a class="underline" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-pachmarhi/">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Pachmarhi</a></p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Nearby destinations</h2><div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a class="rounded-full bg-[var(--sand)] px-3 py-1 text-sm" href="/destinations/jabalpur/">Jabalpur</a><a class="rounded-full bg-[var(--sand)] px-3 py-1 text-sm" href="/destinations/bhedaghat/">Bhedaghat</a><a class="rounded-full bg-[var(--sand)] px-3 py-1 text-sm" href="/destinations/k