","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How can I book a taxi in Jabalpur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Call +91 9329672540, WhatsApp the same number, or send the quote form with pickup, drop and date."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What taxi services are available in Jabalpur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Local, outstation, airport, railway, sightseeing, one-way, round-trip, chauffeur-driven rental, Tempo Traveller (subject to availability) and MP tour cars."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book an outstation taxi from Jabalpur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Share destination and dates for a written quote."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a one-way taxi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. One-way and round-trip are quoted differently."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a round-trip taxi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, including multi-day with night halt as agreed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I hire a car with driver?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Shukla Travels focuses on chauffeur-driven cars."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book Jabalpur airport taxi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, for Dumna Airport (JLR) pickup and drop."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book Jabalpur railway station taxi?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, including Jabalpur Junction."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I plan a customized MP tour?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Use Plan Your MP Trip, Build Your Own Tour, or message your list of places."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a Kanha tour from Jabalpur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Transport is arranged by us; safari permits follow forest department rules."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book a Bandhavgarh tour from Jabalpur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, on the same pattern as Kanha."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which national parks can I visit from Jabalpur?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Kanha and Bandhavgarh are the most practical. Pench, Satpura and Panna are possible with longer or different routing."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I arrange a family tour?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Tell us ages and pace."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I arrange a wildlife tour?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We plan vehicles and days; we do not guarantee sightings or permits."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book corporate transportation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Share company contact, GST needs and movement pattern."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you publish taxi fares?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No public fare table. Quotes depend on route, vehicle, dates and inclusions."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you take online payment on this website?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"This site collects enquiries. Payment method is confirmed when your quote is accepted."}}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="container-st py-4 text-sm text-stone-600"><ol class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><a class="hover:underline" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><span>/</span><span class="text-stone-800">FAQ</span></li></ol></nav><div class="container-st max-w-3xl pb-16"><h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Frequently asked questions</h1><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">How can I book a taxi in Jabalpur?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Call +91 9329672540, WhatsApp the same number, or send the quote form with pickup, drop and date.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">What taxi services are available in Jabalpur?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Local, outstation, airport, railway, sightseeing, one-way, round-trip, chauffeur-driven rental, Tempo Traveller (subject to availability) and MP tour cars.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I book an outstation taxi from Jabalpur?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes. Share destination and dates for a written quote.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I book a one-way taxi?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes. One-way and round-trip are quoted differently.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I book a round-trip taxi?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes, including multi-day with night halt as agreed.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I hire a car with driver?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes. Shukla Travels focuses on chauffeur-driven cars.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I book Jabalpur airport taxi?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes, for Dumna Airport (JLR) pickup and drop.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I book Jabalpur railway station taxi?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes, including Jabalpur Junction.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I plan a customized MP tour?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes. Use Plan Your MP Trip, Build Your Own Tour, or message your list of places.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I book a Kanha tour from Jabalpur?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes. Transport is arranged by us; safari permits follow forest department rules.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I book a Bandhavgarh tour from Jabalpur?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes, on the same pattern as Kanha.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Which national parks can I visit from Jabalpur?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Kanha and Bandhavgarh are the most practical. Pench, Satpura and Panna are possible with longer or different routing.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I arrange a family tour?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes. Tell us ages and pace.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I arrange a wildlife tour?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes. We plan vehicles and days; we do not guarantee sightings or permits.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Can I book corporate transportation?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Yes. Share company contact, GST needs and movement pattern.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Do you publish taxi fares?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">No public fare table. Quotes depend on route, vehicle, dates and inclusions.</p></details><details class="mt-3 rounded-lg border bg-white p-4"><summary class="font-medium">Do you take online payment on this website?</summary><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">This site collects enquiries. Payment method is confirmed when your quote is accepted.</p></details></div></main><footer class="mt-16 bg-[var(--forest-deep)] text-stone-300"><div class="container-st grid gap-10 py-12 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-6"><div class="lg:col-span-2"><img alt="Shukla Travels" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="mb-3 h-14 w-14 rounded-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/asset