ch-national-park/"><div class="relative h-40"><img alt="Pench National Park" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/images/home/kanha.jpg"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-xs">Seoni–Chhindwara landscape, Madhya Pradesh (Maharashtra side adjoining)</p><h2 class="font-semibold">Pench National Park</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Teak forests and river country shared in name with the Maharashtra Pench.</p></div></a><a class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border bg-white" href="/national-parks/satpura-national-park/"><div class="relative h-40"><img alt="Satpura National Park" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/images/destinations/pachmarhi.jpg"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-xs">Hoshangabad / Narmadapuram–Pachmarhi landscape</p><h2 class="font-semibold">Satpura National Park</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Satpura hills, Denwa river and a mix of wildlife tourism styles when offered.</p></div></a><a class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border bg-white" href="/national-parks/panna-national-park/"><div class="relative h-40"><img alt="Panna National Park" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/images/home/kanha.jpg"/></div><div class="p-4"><p class="text-xs">Panna district, near Khajuraho</p><h2 class="font-semibold">Panna National Park</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Ken river tiger reserve next to the Khajuraho heritage belt.</p></div></a><a class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border bg-white" href="/national-parks/sanjay-national-park/"><div class="relative h-40"><img alt="Sanjay National Park" loading="lazy" decoding="async" da