th d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></header><main id="main"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"Kanha National Park","url":"https://www.shuklatravelsindia.com/national-parks/kanha-national-park/","description":"Sal forests, meadows and a flagship central Indian tiger landscape.","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"Shukla Travels","url":"https://www.shuklatravelsindia.com"}}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.shuklatravelsindia.com"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"National Parks","item":"https://www.shuklatravelsindia.com/national-parks/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Kanha National Park","item":"https://www.shuklatravelsindia.com/national-parks/kanha-national-park/"}]}</script><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book Kanha safari from Shukla Travels?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We help with transport and itinerary. Permits are issued by the forest department. Availability is not in our control."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which Kanha zone is best?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"There is no single answer. Zone depends on permit luck and stay location."}}]}</script><div class="relative h-72"><img alt="Kanha National Park" fetchPriority="high" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" src="/assets/images/home/kanha.jpg"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/45"></div><div class="container-st relative z-10 flex h-full flex-col justify-end pb-8 text-white"><h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold">Kanha National Park</h1><p>Mandla / Balaghat region, Madhya Pradesh<!-- --> · <!-- -->Tiger reserve</p></div></div><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="container-st py-4 text-sm text-stone-600"><ol class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><a class="hover:underline" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><span>/</span><a class="hover:underline" href="/national-parks/">National Parks</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><span>/</span><span class="text-stone-800">Kanha National Park</span></li></ol></nav><div class="container-st grid gap-10 pb-16 lg:grid-cols-3"><div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-6"><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Overview</h2><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Kanha National Park is part of the Kanha Tiger Reserve. It is known for sal forest, meadows and a long-running conservation programme that also supported the hard-ground barasingha. Safari access is by official permit in designated zones.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Safari information</h2><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Jeep safaris are the usual product. Permits, fees, zone allocation and timings are set by the Madhya Pradesh forest department and can change. Book only through official channels. Shukla Travels does not sell unofficial permits and does not quote safari fees here because they change.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Best time to visit</h2><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">The park is typically closed in the monsoon. Peak visitor season is cooler months. Confirm current open/close dates on the official MP online safari portal before you travel.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">How to reach</h2><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Most guests drive from Jabalpur. Some use Gondia or other railheads depending on lodge location. Always match the gate to your hotel.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Jabalpur connectivity</h2><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">Jabalpur is one of the most used gateways. Shukla Travels arranges Jabalpur–Kanha taxis and tour planning.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Suggested duration</h2><p class="mt-2 text-stone-700">2 nights / 3 days is a common first visit; add nights for more safari attempts.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Why visit</h2><ul class="list-disc pl-5"><li>Classic central Indian forest</li><li>Strong conservation story</li><li>Practical road access from Jabalpur</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Wildlife</h2><ul class="list-disc pl-5"><li>Bengal tiger</li><li>Hard-ground barasingha</li><li>Gaur</li><li>Spotted deer</li><li>Wild dog (dhole)</li><li>Rich birdlife</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Main attractions</h2><ul class="list-disc pl-5"><li>Core safari zones (permit based)</li><li>Meadow landscapes</li><li>Interpretation facilities at some gates</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Travel tips</h2><ul class="list-disc pl-5"><li>Match lodge and safari gate.</li><li>Carry warm layers for winter mornings.</li><li>Sightings are never guaranteed.</li><li>Follow forest guide instructions.</li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Suggested itinerary</h2><p><strong>Day 1<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Transfer from Jabalpur. Evening rest.</p><p><strong>Day 2<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Morning safari if permit confirmed. Afternoon safari or rest.</p><p><strong>Day 3<!-- -->:</strong> <!-- -->Optional safari and return.</p></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Taxi options</h2><a class="underline" href="/taxi-services/outstation-taxi/">Outstation taxi from Jabalpur</a></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Related tour packages</h2><ul><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/wildlife-tours/jabalpur-kanha-tour/">Jabalpur Kanha Tour</a></li><li><a class="underline" href="/tours/wildlife-tours/kanha-wildlife-tour/">Kanha Wildlife Tour</a></li></ul></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Nearby destinations</h2><a class="mr-2 text-sm underline" href="/destinations/jabalpur/">Jabalpur</a><a class="mr-2 text-sm underline" href="/destinations/bhedaghat/">Bhedaghat</a><a class="mr-2 text-sm underline" href="/destinations/kanha/">Kanha</a><a class="mr-2 text-sm underline" href="/destinations/bandhavgarh/">Bandhavgarh</a><a class="mr-2 text-sm underline" href="/destinations/pench/">Pench</a></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">FAQs</h2><details class="mt-2 border p-3 bg-white"><summary>Can I book Kanha safari from Shukla Travels?</summary><p class="text-sm mt-1">We help with transport and itinerary. Permits are issued by the forest department. Availability is not in our control.</p></details><details class="mt-2 border p-3 bg-white"><summary>Which Kanha zone is best?</summary><p class="text-sm mt-1">There is no single answer. Zone depends on permit luck and stay location.</p></details></section><a class="btn btn-wa" href="https://wa.me/919329672540?text=Hello%20Shukla%20Travels%2C%20I%20would%20like%20to%20enquire%20about%20Kanha%20National%20Park.">WhatsApp</a></div><div class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-6" id="book"><div class="mb-4 flex gap-2"><button type="button" class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-sm capitalize bg-[var(--forest)] text-white">Taxi booking</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-sm capitalize bg-[var(--sand)]">Tour enquiry</button><button type="button" class="rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-sm capitalize bg-[var(--sand)]">Custom trip</button></div><form class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><label for="name">Full name</label><input id="na