readcrumb" class="container-st py-4 text-sm text-stone-600"><ol class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><a class="hover:underline" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1"><span>/</span><span class="text-stone-800">Routes</span></li></ol></nav><div class="container-st pb-16"><h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold text-[var(--forest)]">Jabalpur routes</h1><p class="mt-2 text-stone-600">Distances and times are approximate bands, confirmed when you book — not fake exact figures.</p><div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2"><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-kanha/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Kanha</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">The most requested wildlife transfer from Jabalpur. Exact kilometres depend on the Kanha gate (Kisli, Mukki, Sarhi and others).</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-bandhavgarh/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Bandhavgarh</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Regular outstation route toward Umaria/Tala and other Bandhavgarh gates.</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-pench/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Pench</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Longer than Kanha for most Jabalpur guests. Confirm MP vs Maharashtra lodge.</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-pachmarhi/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Pachmarhi</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Hill-station outstation favourite. Last stretch is ghat road.</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-amarkantak/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Amarkantak</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Pilgrimage and plateau drive east of Jabalpur.</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-khajuraho/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Khajuraho</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Heritage highway day. Not a short hop.</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-panna/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Panna</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Usually the Khajuraho–Panna belt rather than a separate isolated drop.</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-satpura/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Satpura</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Toward Madhai / Pachmarhi–Satpura entries.</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-ujjain/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Ujjain</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Long pilgrimage outstation across the state.</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a><a class="rounded-xl border bg-white p-5" href="/routes/jabalpur-to-omkareshwar/"><h2 class="font-semibold">Jabalpur<!-- --> to <!-- -->Omkareshwar</h2><p class="text-sm text-stone-600">Long Narmada-west pilgrimage drive.</p><span class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--earth)]">Explore route</span></a></div></